    <briefdescription>
<para>A unit of work of a table-level full-text search, planned by <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_scan" kindref="compound">FullTextScan</ref></computeroutput> and searched by <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_read" kindref="compound">FullTextRead</ref></computeroutput>, aligned with Java <computeroutput>org.apache.paimon.table.source.FullTextSearchSplit</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Splits can be serialized, so that a search can be planned in one process and run in others. The encoding is specific to Paimon C++: Java Paimon serializes its splits with Java serialization, so there is no cross-language format to match. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
